34'),(20,10,'Next Steps','next-steps','A focused lesson covering Next Steps.','<h2>Next Steps</h2><p>Explore the key ideas in this lesson, follow the examples, and complete the suggested practice before continuing.</p>','text',20,2,0,1,'2026-07-14 18:46:34','2026-07-14 18:41:48','2026-07-14 18:46:34'),(21,11,'Welcome and Learning Roadmap','welcome-and-learning-roadmap','A focused Professional English Communication lesson covering Welcome and Learning Roadmap.','<h2>Welcome and Learning Roadmap</h2><p>In this lesson, you will connect the principles of Professional English Communication to a realistic professional scenario. Start by identifying the goal, the available information, and the quality criteria for a successful result.</p><h3>Key ideas</h3><ul><li>Break complex work into observable, testable steps.</li><li>Use feedback early instead of waiting until the end.</li><li>Document important decisions and assumptions.</li></ul><h3>Practice</h3><p>Create a short example of your own, explain why it works, and identify one improvement you would make after receiving feedback.</p>','text',15,1,1,1,'2026-07-22 16:58:52','2026-07-14 18:41:48','2026-07-22 16:58:52'),(22,11,'Essential Concepts','essential-concepts','A focused Professional English Communication lesson covering Essential Concepts.','<h2>Essential Concepts</h2><p>In this lesson, you will connect the principles of Professional English Communication to a realistic professional scenario. Start by identifying the goal, the available information, and the quality criteria for a successful result.</p><h3>Key ideas</h3><ul><li>Break complex work into observable, testable steps.</li><li>Use feedback early instead of waiting until the end.</li><li>Document important decisions and assumptions.</li></ul><h3>Video walkthrough</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ysz5S6PUM-U\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Watch the accompanying sample lesson on YouTube</a>.</p><h3>Practice</h3><p>Create a short example of your own, explain why it works, and identify one improvement you would make after receiving feedback.</p>','text',20,2,0,1,'2026-07-22 16:58:52','2026-07-14 18:41:48','2026-07-22 16:58:52'),(23,12,'Working with the Core Workflow','working-with-the-core-workflow','A focused Professional English Communication lesson covering Working with the Core Workflow.','<h2>Working with the Core Workflow</h2><p>In this lesson, you will connect the principles of Professional English Communication to a realistic professional scenario. Start by identifying the goal, the available information, and the quality criteria for a successful result.</p><h3>Key ideas</h3><ul><li>Break complex work into observable, testable steps.</li><li>Use feedback early instead of waiting until the end.</li><li>Document important decisions and assumptions.</li></ul><h3>Practice</h3><p>Create a short example of your own, explain why it works, and identify one improvement you would make after receiving feedback.</p>','text',20,1,0,1,'2026-07-22 16:58:52','2026-07-14 18:41:48','2026-07-22 16:58:52'),(24,12,'Guided Real-World Example','guided-real-world-example','A focused Professional English Communication lesson covering Guided Real-World Example.','<h2>Guided Real-World Example</h2><p>In this lesson, you will connect the principles of Professional English Communication to a realistic professional scenario. Start by identifying the goal, the available information, and the quality criteria for a successful result.</p><h3>Key ideas</h3><ul><li>Break complex work into observable, testable steps.</li><li>Use feedback early instead of waiting until the end.</li><li>Document important decisions and assumptions.</li></ul><h3>Video walkthrough</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ysz5S6PUM-U\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Watch the accompanying sample lesson on YouTube</a>.</p><h3>Practice</h3><p>Create a short example of your own, explain why it works, and identify one improvement you would make